.\docs\evidence\deploy-target-2026-09-15\index.html:1:<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Deploy target (2026-09-15): 14 consecutive main deploys failed before any check ran; verify green, site stale at 34747bd6</title><style>body{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:64rem;margin:2rem auto;padding:0 1rem;color:#12232e}code{background:#f1f3f5;padding:0 .2em;word-break:break-all}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}td,th{border-top:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4em .5em;vertical-align:top;text-align:left}.note{border-left:4px solid #b45309;padding:.5em 1em;background:#fffbeb}.sha{font-size:.85em}</style></head><body><h1>Deploy target (2026-09-15): 14 consecutive main deploys failed before any check ran; verify green, site stale at 34747bd6</h1><p class="note"><strong>Raw captures, served as committed.</strong> Every file below is served byte-for-byte as committed under <code>docs/evidence/deploy-target-2026-09-15/</code>; the SHA-256 shown is of those bytes. Fetch the URL, hash the body, compare. This index page is generated from <code>CAPTIONS.json</code> and is the only non-capture file here.</p><p>Since d15867aa (2026-09-14 22:22Z) the checkout-free deploy job ran scripts/production_record.py without the harness package it imports and died on ModuleNotFoundError before checking anything; with the package shipped it would have died on `ref not resolvable: HEAD` because there is no repository in the job. Every landing since -- including the search benchmark and search_v2 -- is on GitHub and NOT live. The deploy job now names its target from the manifest it was handed (commit_sha as head, the manifest digest as tree) and still refuses a tampered artifact.</p><table><tr><th>file: HTML rendering / raw (full URLs)</th><th>what it proves</th><th>size / SHA-256 of committed bytes</th></tr><tr><td><a href="01-simulated-deploy-before-after.txt.html">01-simulated-deploy-before-after.txt (HTML rendering)</a> · <a href="01-simulated-deploy-before-after.txt">raw</a><br><code>https://mahmood726-cyber.github.io/meta-harness/evidence/deploy-target-2026-09-15/01-simulated-deploy-before-after.txt.html</code><br><code>https://mahmood726-cyber.github.io/meta-harness/evidence/deploy-target-2026-09-15/01-simulated-deploy-before-after.txt</code></td><td>The deploy job simulated locally (no .git, only the artifact files): pre-fix without harness (CI&#x27;s failure), pre-fix with harness (the second failure CI never reached), post-fix intact artifact (passes, target named from the manifest), post-fix TAMPERED artifact (refused: differ=[&#x27;index.html&#x27;]). Exit codes read without a pipe.</td><td class='sha'>1,551 B<br><code>df248b5edb022d91d9f76f8403fca5a047cd0dde2e86a34859b092a7a5e6c3c4</code></td></tr><tr><td><a href="02-main-runs-deploy-failures.txt.html">02-main-runs-deploy-failures.txt (HTML rendering)</a> · <a href="02-main-runs-deploy-failures.txt">raw</a><br><code>https://mahmood726-cyber.github.io/meta-harness/evidence/deploy-target-2026-09-15/02-main-runs-deploy-failures.txt.html</code><br><code>https://mahmood726-cyber.github.io/meta-harness/evidence/deploy-target-2026-09-15/02-main-runs-deploy-failures.txt</code></td><td>gh run list on main: 14 failures from d15867aa to 01e39f2e, last success 34747bd6 (2026-09-14 22:04Z); the failing job&#x27;s steps and the ModuleNotFoundError lines from the 01e39f2e run.</td><td class='sha'>1,149 B<br><code>840f900c25321fdab7ed9e85597317a4ff940e6d29096d797c87c464fb8b1833</code></td></tr></table><p><a href="../">All evidence</a> · <a href="../../_production/manifest.json">per-file manifest of the deployed tree</a></p></body></html>
